{"id":"s1hmv03crhntjmcqtkmal416g","title":"险资差异化配置银行股","originalTitle":"有进有退，险资差异化配置银行股","summary":"今年以来，险资机构投资银行股出现分化，中小险企如和谐健康保险和富德生命人寿卖出银行股，而大型险企如中国人寿和平安人寿则买入国有大型银行股。业内人士认为，不同规模的险资机构因资产负债质量差异，投资策略和节奏有所不同。未来险资仍有望增配银行等红利资产，但选择投资标的将更加精细。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"36氪"},"links":{"original":"https://36kr.com/newsflashes/4064582596072324?f=rss"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T23:58:48.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T00:12:08.660Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T00:12:08.660Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"23076408-8dfe-44a9-aa61-bde3055f84af","title":"险资配置银行股呈现分化趋势"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"23076408-8dfe-44a9-aa61-bde3055f84af","title":"险资配置银行股呈现分化趋势"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fnEqKkzvvsnA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}